  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given the height `H` and width `W`, print a rectangle using asterisk (*) characters.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe input consists of two integers, `H` and `W`, separated by a space.\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nPrint a rectangle of height `H` and width `W` using the `*` character. Each row should have `W` asterisks, and there should be `H` rows.",
